---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Complicated AI concepts explained simply
description: Ten practical, beginner-friendly courses for understanding and using modern AI with clarity, judgment, and care.
permalink: /index.html
---
<section class="home-hero shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">A practical learning path for modern AI</p>
  <h1>Complicated AI concepts <span>explained simply.</span></h1>
  <p class="home-hero__lead">Ten focused courses help you understand what AI is, communicate with it, design reliable workflows, and use it responsibly—without assuming a technical background.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button-link" href="{{ courses[0].publicStudyUrlPath | url }}">Start with Course 1</a>
    <a class="text-link" href="#courses">Explore all courses</a>
  </div>
  <dl class="course-stats" aria-label="Learning path summary">
    <div><dt>10</dt><dd>Courses</dd></div>
    <div><dt>1</dt><dd>Clear sequence</dd></div>
    <div><dt>0</dt><dd>Prerequisites</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="course-catalog shell" id="courses" aria-labelledby="courses-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The complete learning path</p>
      <h2 id="courses-heading">Build understanding one course at a time</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Follow the sequence or jump directly to the idea you need. Every lesson keeps the full study material available without requiring JavaScript.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="course-grid">
    {% for item in courses %}
      <li class="course-card">
        <span class="course-card__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ item.number | pad2 }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="course-card__label">Course {{ item.number }}</p>
          <h3><a href="{{ item.publicStudyUrlPath | url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
        </div>
        <a class="card-action" href="{{ item.publicStudyUrlPath | url }}" aria-label="Start Course {{ item.number }}: {{ item.title }}">Start Course <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="about-panel shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Independent learning resource</p>
  <h2 id="about-heading">Clear presentation, transparent sourcing</h2>
  <p>This website reorganizes supplied Agent Factory / Panaversity study guides into one consistent learning experience. It preserves the educational substance, links to verified official sources, and clearly separates this project’s presentation from the original publisher.</p>
</section>
